string container up to 128 chars
strlen_t: 1 byte, 0-255 values

bytes |   8 16 32 64 128
elems |   5 13 29 61 125 if self_size is constant val, then +1 to all elems
slabs | 128 64 32 16   8

total mcaches:5
with the extension to 256-1 sized slab
!IMPORTANT!
  256 is not available for uint8 strlen_t type
  so 255 is absolutely crucial

if we want we can go for 8 mcaches or more
by creating more granular slab sizes


For text with more than 255 characters:
make use of another allocator

# lifetime: static
  create a dynamicaly grown arena
  memory continuity does not matter
  + no wasted memory (except on non contiguous memory ends)
  + dynamicaly extended

